<title>USA: U.S. coffee roastings rise in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee roastings rise in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Coffee Coverage reported U.S. green coffee roastings as follows:</p>
<p>For the week ended Nov 16, roastings totaled about 370,000 60-kg bags, up from 365,000 bags the prior week and from 330,000 bags in the corresponding week a year ago.</p>
<p>Cumulative roastings totaled 15,250,000 bags versus 14,715,000 in the same year-ago period.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
